#EXTM3U
# Live TV playlist for Jellyfin's M3U tuner.
#
# THIS FILE IS AN EXAMPLE. Copy it to `iptv-fr.m3u` beside this one and put your
# own channels in it; that name is gitignored, and the task below skips silently
# when it is absent, so a clone without one deploys fine.
#
#   cp iptv-fr.m3u.example iptv-fr.m3u
#
# It is not committed because a channel list is a personal subscription: it names
# the streams you are entitled to, and on most ISPs the URLs carry
# operator-specific hosts that identify the provider.
#
# One line per channel, each #EXTINF followed by its stream URL:

#EXTINF:-1 tvg-chno="1" tvg-id="Example1.fr" group-title="Example",Example Channel 1
https://example.invalid/live/example1/index.m3u8

#EXTINF:-1 tvg-chno="2" tvg-id="Example2.fr" group-title="Example",Example Channel 2
https://example.invalid/live/example2/index.m3u8
